## Course Overview

This course provides a comprehensive introduction to safety-critical control architectures in railway engineering, train protection systems (ATP/ATO/ATS), and fail-safe interlocking logic design.

## Topics Covered

- Railway Interlocking Principles & Vital Logic Design
- Automatic Train Control Frameworks (ETCS / CBTC)
- Fixed Block vs. Moving Block Signaling Architectures
- Safety-Critical System Design & SIL (Safety Integrity Level) Standards

